<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Videos-gratuit</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #0f172a;
        --card: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.8);
        --primary: #8b5cf6;
        --secondary: #22c55e;
        --text: #e5e7eb;
        --muted: #94a3b8;
        --border: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #020817 0%, #111827 50%, #0f172a 100%);
        color: var(--text);
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .container {
        width: min(900px, 90%);
        background: var(--card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .hero {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 50px 40px;
      }

      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.12);
        color: #bbf7d0;
        border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.35);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 8px 14px;
        font-size: 12px;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin: 18px 0 16px;
      }

      p {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 0 0 26px;
      }

      .actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 16px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 16px 28px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 700;
        transition: 0.2s ease;
      }

      .btn-primary {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #6366f1);
        color: white;
        box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
      }

      .btn-secondary {
        color: var(--text);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      }

      .btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .image-box {
        min-height: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.18), rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.12));
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .image-box img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        max-height: 420px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 20px;
        display: block;
      }

      .stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .stat {
        padding: 16px 14px;
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 16px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .stat strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }

      .stat span {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .hero {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .content {
          padding: 32px 22px;
        }

        .stats {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero">
        <div class="content">
          <span class="badge">Plateforme gratuite</span>
          <h1>Accédez à votre application</h1>
          <p>
            Découvrez une interface moderne pour regarder des vidéos, explorer des contenus
            visuels et profiter d'une expérience simple, rapide et agréable.
          </p>

          <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="app.html">Accéder à l'application</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#plus">En savoir plus</a>
          </div>

          <div class="stats" id="plus">
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>2K+</strong>
              <span>Vidéos</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>150+</strong>
              <span>Catégories</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>4.9/5</strong>
              <span>Note</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="image-box">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492691527719-9d1e07e534b4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80"
            alt="Vidéo et contenu visuel"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
